==Match==
[[File:Habitación de Pelé en el CISS - 16.jpg|thumb|Recreation of Pelé's room at the Inter-American Social Security Conference Hotel of Mexico City, their hotel prior to their match against Italy on June 21, 1970.]]
===Summary===
{{multiple image
| header =
| align = 
| direction = 
| total_width = 450
| perrow = 2
| image1 = Brazil v italia 1970 01.jpg 
